      "Compare arrivals and completions, not only the backlog total. Check that the owner is actually available before assigning. Keep the queue view readable on one screen. Keep the original request so a later correction does not erase the reason for the work. For write-off review, the working file keeps write-off list and approval note beside the decision note. Outsourced Billing Services treats a missing write-off list as an open item, not as a passed check.",
