      "When access blocks the work, name the system, role, and approver. Keep the failed attempt and the correction in the same history. Separate a data conflict from a policy conflict. A short written rule is easier to test than an unwritten habit. In this payer account handoff note case, the record points to the payer file and names the billing manager as the decision owner. A payer account handoff note handoff at Outsourced Billing Services ends only when the next reviewer can act from the written record.",
      "## Close with a verified destination value",
