      "Keep the prior procedure available for comparison. Report a null result as clearly as a positive one. A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. Check whether the definition changed during the period. The payer account handoff note case note should show what the payer file held at the time and who reviewed it. Outsourced Billing Services keeps the payer account handoff note source, reviewer, and decision date together in the payer file so a later check does not depend on memory.",
